306
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:09,160
You were near Ngai Ka-yan's office
during the livestreaming,

307
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:12,760
between noon and 1:50 p.m.,

308
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:14,640
you should have seen anyone

309
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:16,080
in and out of Ngai Ka-yan's office.

310
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:20,080
Yes, but I don't recall seeing anyone
in and out.

311
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,920
If she was telling the truth,

312
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,480
the only window to do the swap
in Ngai Ka-yan's office

313
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:27,760
is now down to ten minutes
between 1:50 p.m. and 2 p.m.

314
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:31,200
Good job just now.

315
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,320
Thanks.

316
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,400
I'll let you wrap up.

317
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,840
I cleaned up the livestreaming room,

318
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:38,440
and took the garbage to the back stairs.

319
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:42,600
After that, I went inside the toilet
for a touch up.

320
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:46,080
After you took out the garbage,

321
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:47,520
