322
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:48,680
Or did you go somewhere else?

323
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,320
Because I had makeup in my bag,

324
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:52,560
I went straight to the toilet.

325
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:55,120
Did you hear any weird noises outside?

326
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:57,160
No.

327
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:59,520
Where did you go after you finish
touching up?

328
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:02,920
I was thirsty, so I went to the pantry
for some water.

329
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:08,280
Jarvis, Tom and Auntie Ching came in
from the back stairs soon afterwards.

330
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:09,480
It's almost 2 o'clock.

331
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:10,520
You should head down to the pool.

332
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:11,920
All set and ready to go.

333
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:14,240
Go down for the set up. I'll be down later.

334
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:17,000
After that, I helped them pack up everything

335
00:18:17,080 --> 00:18:18,680
and headed for the pool.

336
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:22,040
You said after you finished the
livestreaming with Wendy,

337
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,960
