339
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,560
After I finished the livestreaming,

340
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:30,840
I went inside the conference room
for the video call.

341
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:34,840
Right, Mr Cheng...

342
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:36,920
The video call went rather well,

343
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:39,120
