344
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:41,200
I heard something break outside.

345
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:45,800
Sorry...that's the gist of the content.

346
00:18:45,840 --> 00:18:48,760
Call me if you need any changes. Bye!

347
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,840
I went outside and saw shards on the floor.

348
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:51,960
Then Tom came out as well.

349
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:52,760
Who broke this?

350
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:54,160
I don't know.

351
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:56,840
I was in the supplies room checking
the props of the Challenge.

352
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,600
Did you check on the weight belts?

353
00:18:58,760 --> 00:18:59,320
Not yet.

354
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:01,960
Can you check while I run to the toilet?

355
00:19:02,840 --> 00:19:05,840
Auntie Ching, something is broken,
can you clean this up?

356
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,000
How long were you in the supplies room?

357
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,760
What did you see when you came out?

358
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,800
We didn't have that many weight belts.

359
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:13,440
It didn't take me too long to check.

360
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:18,080
When I came out, I saw Jarvis, Tom
and Auntie Ching

361
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,400
come in from the back stairs.

362
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:22,320
I also saw Wendy come out of the pantry.

363
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:25,760
Then Tom and I packed up everything
and headed to the pool.

364
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:31,920
Tsang Chun-kit, on that day,
between 1:50 p.m. to 2:00 p.m.,

365
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,680
what were you doing at the office?

366
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:36,720
Paul and Wendy had a livestreaming,

367
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:40,160
I was in the supplies room checking on
the props.

368
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:43,760
Who broke this?

369
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:44,760
I don't know.

370
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:47,560
I was in the supplies room checking
the props of the Challenge.

371
00:19:47,800 --> 00:19:49,280
Did you check on the weight belts?

372
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:50,040
Not yet.

373
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:52,400
Can you check while I run to the toilet?

374
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:54,960
What did you do after you came out
of the toilet?

375
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,440
I came out of the toilet...

376
00:19:56,560 --> 00:19:58,480
Auntie Ching, you haven't cleaned up
the shards?

377
00:19:58,560 --> 00:19:59,240
Let me help you.

378
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:00,280
Great!

379
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:02,240
I helped her clean that up

380
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:05,240
and we threw it out to the back stairs.

381
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:07,760
Jarvis came back at that time

382
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:10,120
and the three of us went back
into the office.

383
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,920
Tom, what are you doing here?

384
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:13,320
You have nothing better to do?

385
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:14,800
Get back in...

386
00:20:15,040 --> 00:20:16,920
Wendy came from the pantry

387
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:21,440
and Jarvis told us to head down to the pool.

388
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:24,080
Paul, Wendy and I left in a hurry.

389
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:29,360
Yuen Kit-ching, at 1:50 p.m. on that day,

390
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:31,080
