391
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:35,240
Yes, I was making red bean soup.

392
00:20:35,360 --> 00:20:37,360
After I finished making it,

393
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:39,240
I went outside and saw shards on the floor.

394
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:41,720
Tom came from the toilet.

395
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,880
Why are there shards on the floor?

396
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:46,000
Auntie Ching, you haven't cleaned up
