397
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:46,800
Let me help you.

398
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:47,960
Great!

399
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,800
There should be a noise when something broke

400
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:51,360
