404
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,080
Then what happened?

405
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:09,360
Tom helped me throw out the shards
in the back stairs.

406
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:12,600
Jarvis came back at the same time

407
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:16,720
